// The clinic's OWN cohort filters. argument_expanders AUTOGENERATES one filter control per
// referenced data_function (a categorical collection -> a checkbox filter; a numeric variable ->
// a range filter) — no hand-written argument objects. This is the curated part: YOU choose which
// collections become filters by listing their data_functions here.
//
// Uses the wrapped `argument_set_definition` form (best practice). `method` is a set-level
// override applied to every generated filter, so it stays a top-level sibling of the definition.
{
  "argument_set_definition": {
    "argument_set_type": "optional",
    "name": "cohort_clinic",
    "title": "Clinic Filters"
  },
  "method": "summary",
  "argument_expanders": [
    "protocols/data_functions/categorical_collection_department.json",
    "protocols/data_functions/categorical_collection_diagnosis.json",
    "protocols/data_functions/numeric_collection_blood_pressure_systolic.json"
  ]
}
